{"seq":8,"slug":"lc0124-binary-tree-max-path-sum","title":"LeetCode 124 二叉树中的最大路径和","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-comprehensive/lc0124-binary-tree-max-path-sum","wordCount":996,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-124-二叉树中的最大路径和\">LeetCode 124 二叉树中的最大路径和</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个非空二叉树的根节点 <code>root</code>，返回其最大路径和。</p>\n<p>路径被定义为一条从树中任意节点出发，沿父节点-子节点连接，达到任意节点的序列。同一个节点在一条路径序列中至多出现一次。该路径至少包含一个节点，且不一定经过根节点。</p>\n<p><strong>示例：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：root = [1,2,3]&#10;输出：6&#10;解释：最优路径是 2 → 1 → 3，路径和为 2 + 1 + 3 = 6&#10;&#10;输入：root = [-10,9,20,null,null,15,7]&#10;输出：42&#10;解释：最优路径是 15 → 20 → 7，路径和为 15 + 20 + 7 = 42\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：root = [1,2,3]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：最优路径是 2 → 1 → 3，路径和为 2 + 1 + 3 = 6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输入：root = [-10,9,20,null,null,15,7]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：最优路径是 15 → 20 → 7，路径和为 15 + 20 + 7 = 42</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>树中节点数目范围 <code>[1, 3 × 10⁴]</code></li>\n<li><code>-1000 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 1000</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题的难点在于理解&quot;路径&quot;的定义：路径可以从任意节点开始到任意节点结束，不一定经过根节点，且路径中节点不能重复使用。</p>\n<p><strong>关键区分：</strong> 对于每个节点，有两种角色：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>作为路径的&quot;拐点&quot;（最高节点）：</strong> 路径从左子树上来，经过当前节点，延伸到右子树。此时路径和 = 左子树贡献 + 节点值 + 右子树贡献。</li>\n<li><strong>作为路径的&quot;中间节点&quot;：</strong> 当前节点向上提供贡献给其父节点。此时只能选择左右子树中贡献较大的一侧（不能同时选两侧，否则路径会分叉）。</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>路径形态</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拐点</td>\n<td>左 → 节点 → 右</td>\n<td>left + val + right</td>\n<td>更新全局最大值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间节点</td>\n<td>左/右 → 节点 → 父</td>\n<td>val + max(left, right)</td>\n<td>向上返回贡献</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>后序遍历（DFS）：</strong> 从叶子节点开始，自底向上计算每个节点能向上提供的最大贡献。同时在每个节点处，计算以该节点为拐点的路径和，更新全局最大值。</p>\n<p><strong>负值处理：</strong> 如果子树的贡献为负，不如不选（贡献为 0）。因此 <code>left = Math.max(0, dfs(node.left))</code>，将负贡献截断为 0。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TreeNode {&#10;  val: number;&#10;  left: TreeNode | null;&#10;  right: TreeNode | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function maxPathSum(root: TreeNode | null): number {&#10;  let globalMax = -Infinity;&#10;&#10;  function dfs(node: TreeNode | null): number {&#10;    if (node === null) return 0;&#10;&#10;    const leftGain = Math.max(0, dfs(node.left));&#10;    const rightGain = Math.max(0, dfs(node.right));&#10;&#10;    const pathThroughNode = node.val + leftGain + rightGain;&#10;    globalMax = Math.max(globalMax, pathThroughNode);&#10;&#10;    return node.val + Math.max(leftGain, rightGain);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  dfs(root);&#10;  return globalMax;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  left</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> maxPathSum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">root</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> globalMax </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Infinity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> leftGain</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.left));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> rightGain</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.right));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pathThroughNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> leftGain </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rightGain;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    globalMax </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(globalMax, pathThroughNode);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(leftGain, rightGain);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  dfs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(root);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> globalMax;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实现要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>globalMax</code> 初始化为 <code>-Infinity</code></strong>：因为节点值可以为负，所有路径和都可能为负数。不能初始化为 0。</li>\n<li><strong><code>Math.max(0, dfs(...))</code></strong>：截断负贡献。如果子树的最大贡献为负，选择不延伸到该子树（等价于路径不经过该子树）。</li>\n<li><strong>拐点路径计算</strong>：<code>pathThroughNode = node.val + leftGain + rightGain</code> 考虑了从左子树经过当前节点到右子树的完整路径。即使某一侧的 gain 为 0（不延伸），该公式仍然正确。</li>\n<li><strong>向上贡献</strong>：<code>return node.val + Math.max(leftGain, rightGain)</code> 只能选择一侧向上延伸。如果选择了左右两侧，路径就会在当前节点分叉，无法继续向上延伸到父节点。</li>\n<li><strong>后序遍历顺序</strong>：必须先递归处理左右子树，得到它们的贡献后，才能计算当前节点的路径和。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>理解&quot;两种角色&quot;是解题关键：</strong></p>\n<p>考虑以下树结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"    -10&#10;   /    \\&#10;  9      20&#10;        /  \\&#10;       15    7\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>    -10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   /    \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  9      20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        /  \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       15    7</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>对于节点 20：作为拐点时，路径和 = 15 + 20 + 7 = 42（全局最优）；作为中间节点时，向上贡献 = 20 + max(15, 7) = 35。</li>\n<li>对于节点 -10：作为拐点时，路径和 = 9 + (-10) + 35 = 34（不如 42 优）。</li>\n<li>全局最大值在节点 20 作为拐点时取得。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>每个节点恰好访问一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间</td>\n<td>O(h)</td>\n<td>h 为树高，递归栈深度；最坏 O(n)（退化为链），平衡树 O(log n)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本题体现了树形 DP（动态规划）的思想：每个节点的最优解依赖于子节点的最优解，通过后序遍历自底向上传递。同时需要在遍历过程中维护全局最优值——因为全局最优路径的&quot;拐点&quot;可以是任意节点。</p>\n<p>类似的&quot;维护全局最优 + 返回局部贡献&quot;模式在很多树的问题中出现：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>二叉树的直径</strong>（LC 543）：同样的后序 DFS，全局维护最大直径</li>\n<li><strong>最长同值路径</strong>（LC 687）：向上贡献条件变为&quot;值相同&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>从叶结点开始的最小字符串</strong>（LC 988）：后序 DFS 收集路径</li>\n</ul>\n<p>掌握这种&quot;后序遍历 + 全局变量 + 局部返回值&quot;的模式，可以高效解决大量树结构的优化问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 124 二叉树中的最大路径和","id":"leetcode-124-二叉树中的最大路径和"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 84 柱状图中最大的矩形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-comprehensive/lc0084-largest-rectangle-in-histogram"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 58 最后一个单词的长度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-array-string/lc0058-length-of-last-word"}}